</style></head><body><h1>IRC channel logs</h1><h2>2024-12-02.log</h2><p><a href="/bootstrappable">back to list of logs</a></p><div id="logs"><div class="line" id="172809"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#172809" label="[17:28:09]">&lt;aggi&gt;</a></span><span class="message">Seems i have to correct myself, Just added dummy symbols to entry.S for the missing nptl syscalls that musl-libc needs</span></div><div class="line" id="172827"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#172827" label="[17:28:27]">&lt;aggi&gt;</a></span><span class="message">and finally some tcc-compiled musl-libc static binaries execute atop tcc-compiled kernel</span></div><div class="line" id="173016"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#173016" label="[17:30:16]">&lt;aggi&gt;</a></span><span class="message">nonetheless ntpl and time64 are relevant to scalability of some tcc/linux-2.x system, hence i'll give this a little more time</span></div><div class="line" id="173054"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#173054" label="[17:30:54]">&lt;aggi&gt;</a></span><span class="message">for bootstrapping a complete tcc driven distribution however, there seems no blocker remaining</span></div><div class="line" id="175044"><span class="nick" style="color:#389600"><a href="#175044" label="[17:50:44]">&lt;aggi&gt;</a></span><span class="message">If someone could offer some s/ftp space i may upload some i486-tcc-linux-musl.iso devdrop pre-releases</span></div><div class="line" id="190624"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#190624" label="[19:06:24]">&lt;clemens3&gt;</a></span><span class="message">tried to get into forth with gforth, but it needs gforth to build, so, there is a pass</span></div><div class="line" id="190659"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#190659" label="[19:06:59]">&lt;clemens3&gt;</a></span><span class="message">cforth build was easy, but dunno where to look for documentation besides the source</span></div><div class="line" id="190741"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#190741" label="[19:07:41]">&lt;clemens3&gt;</a></span><span class="message">aeh, #forth is invite only channel, are they sick?</span></div><div class="line" id="190813"><span class="nick" style="color:#8dd3c7"><a href="#190813" label="[19:08:13]">&lt;clemens3&gt;</a></span><span class="message">why don't they go on a private server then</span></div><div class="line" id="231517"><span class="nick" style="color:#2e2a4a"><a href="#231517" label="[23:15:17]">&lt;oriansj&gt;</a></span><span class="message">aggi: I probably got some spare space on the server that hosts <a rel="nofollow" href="https://files.bootstrapping.world/">https://files.bootstrapping.world/</a> </span></div><br /></div></body></html>